 "result_text": "`quiz.get_all_quiz_submissions()` in `canvasapi/quiz.py` now returns a `PaginatedList` of `QuizSubmission` objects instead of a plain list from a single request. It follows the Canvas pagination links, so it no longer stops at the first 10. I haven't run the test suite or tried it against a Canvas server.\n\nI did not make `page_size` default to 100, as the issue suggests. Callers can pass `per_page=100` themselves to cut down on requests.\n\nThe endpoint nests its results under a `quiz_submissions` key, so I pass that as the list's root. I also updated the docstring's return type.\n\nCode that relied on getting a plain `list` back (for example `len()` on the result) will behave differently. The existing test for this method may also need updating, since I didn't touch any tests.",
